  "enunciado": "A botanical garden is scheduling an educational program. Schedule these 25 activities in slots 1 to 25, with exactly one activity per slot: Badges, Briefing, Checkin, Compost, Count, Farewell, Frogs, Insects, Label, Leaves, Nests, Plant, Pond, Press, Roots, Seeds, Shade, Sketch, Snack, Soil, Stake, Swap, Sweep, Trail, Water.\n1. Badges is scheduled immediately after Checkin.\n2. Briefing is scheduled immediately after Badges.\n3. Seeds is scheduled immediately after Trail.\n4. Roots is scheduled immediately after Seeds.\n5. Leaves is scheduled immediately after Roots.\n6. Soil is scheduled immediately after Shade.\n7. Water is scheduled immediately after Soil.\n8. Frogs is scheduled immediately after Pond.\n9. Insects is scheduled immediately after Frogs.\n10. Nests is scheduled immediately after Insects.\n11. Press is scheduled immediately after Sketch.\n12. Label is scheduled immediately after Press.\n13. Compost is scheduled immediately after Snack.\n14. Plant is scheduled immediately after Swap.\n15. Stake is scheduled immediately after Plant.\n16. Count is scheduled immediately after Sweep.\n17. Farewell is scheduled immediately after Count.\n18. Sweep is scheduled after slot 22.\n19. Briefing takes place before Trail.\n20. Leaves takes place before Shade.\n21. Water takes place before Pond.\n22. Nests takes place before Sketch.\n23. Label takes place before Snack.\n24. Compost takes place before Swap.\nFor each named activity, give its slot number.",
